    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"feature\"><em>Wisdom Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=JgGtkWB3R1iwmbM4]], one creature the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} can see within [[lookup @range.value activity=JgGtkWB3R1iwmbM4]] feet (Constructs and Undead succeed automatically).</p><p class=\"feature\"><em>Failure:</em> The target has the &amp;Reference[Unconscious apply=false] condition for 10 minutes or until it takes damage or a creature within 5 feet of it takes an action to wake it.</p><p class=\"feature\"><em>Success:</em> The target is immune to this [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster}’s Sleep Gaze for 24 hours.</p>",
